      "content": "lists and budgets dont actually change the numbers though. the math just doesn't work. i've tried all that stuff and it's like running on a treadmill that's just going faster and faster. i look at my bank account and i just feel this heavy, hollow feeling in my chest. it's like there's no light at the end of the tunnel, just more debt. it feels like my whole life is just a mistake.",
