      "content": "idk. counselors just charge more money or tell you to work more hours. i'm already working so much and it's still not enough. it just feels like the world is designed to crush people like me. i'm just tired of fighting something that is clearly meant to win. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise and the stress is to just... not be there anymore. to just stop everything.",
